3671   EGISolarGWh(j,z)  Solar GWh per 10 billion $
3672   EGIHydroGWh(j,z)  Hydro GWh per 10 billion $
3673   EGIWasteGWh(j,z)  Waste GWh per 10 billion $
3674   EGIBioGWh(j,z)    bio GWh per 10 billion $
3675   EGIGeoGWh(j,z)    geothermal GWh per 10 billion $
